abstract: >-
  A candidate conceptual-model and requirements baseline for representing
  purposeful conceptualization knowledge. Imported conceptual commitments,
  source qualifications and candidate requirements remain explicit. Structural
  checks and illustrative fixtures do not establish independent semantic or
  expert acceptance. Research material and software have separate license scopes.
